# PART 1 — PRODUCT VISION

## 1.1 Project Vision

Transform the Eyemaze website into a modern, premium, responsive and professionally managed digital platform that represents the company's creative design, printing and business identity.

The website should communicate three things:

1. Eyemaze as a professional creative design brand.
2. Eyemaze as a reliable printing and production service provider.
3. Eyemaze as a customer-friendly business where customers can discover services, explore previous work and request quotations.

## 1.2 Brand Positioning

**Brand Name:** Eyemaze

**Business Category:** Creative Design, Graphics & Printing Solutions.

**Suggested Brand Tagline:**

"Imagine. Design. Print."

Alternative:

"Your Vision, Our Creation."

Nepali alternative:

"तपाईंको कल्पना, हाम्रो सिर्जना।"

## 1.3 Main Product Objectives

- Establish a consistent and recognizable brand identity.
- Make the website visually premium and professionally designed.
- Showcase completed projects through high-quality portfolio presentations.
- Improve service discovery and customer enquiries.
- Create an easy quotation request system.
- Support Nepali and English languages.
