# PART 12 — SECURITY & PERFORMANCE

## Security

- HTTPS everywhere.
- Secure admin authentication.
- Role-based access control.
- Password hashing.
- Server-side validation.
- Rate limiting.
- Spam protection.
- File type validation.
- Attachment size restrictions.
- Private file access using expiring signed links.
- Secure session cookies.
- CSRF protection where applicable.
- Content Security Policy.
- Regular backups.
- Audit logging.
- Minimal customer-data retention.

Do not expose customer-uploaded artwork or private contact details publicly.

## Performance

Targets for the production website:

- LCP: 2.5 seconds or less.
- INP: 200 milliseconds or less.
- CLS: 0.1 or less.

Implementation:

- Optimized images.
- Lazy loading.
- CDN delivery.
- Font optimization.
- Reduced JavaScript.
- Server-side rendering where suitable.
- Caching.
- Database indexing.
- Responsive image sizes.

